  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-005 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, and Sivir. Version 0.7.7 locks Ban/Pick illustrations to the verified Ban/Pick View Plus card coordinates instead of inheriting actor slide-and-scale animation geometry, and deduplicates each blue/red slot to one overlay. It retains the 0.7.6 fixed dragon attack ground anchors and adds a refined Rift visual pass with native map structure, collision, spawn points, and objective locations preserved. Native question cards, swap-phase state, and compact icons remain intact. The pack includes full-body encyclopedia portraits, image-generated objectives, neutral monsters, towers, Nexus crystals, terrain art, minimap art, League-style item art, and locally extracted official Baron audio for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
